#: setupwizard.cpp:128
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt><p>This wizard will ask you a few questions about your network.</p> "
#| "<p>Usually you can simply keep the suggested settings.</p> <p>After you "
#| "have finished the wizard, you will be able to browse and use shared "
#| "resources on your LAN, not only Samba/Windows shares, but also FTP, HTTP "
#| "and NFS resources exactly the same way.</p> <p>Therefore you need to "
#| "setup the <i>LAN Information Server</i> (LISa) on your machine. Think of "
#| "the LISa server as an FTP or HTTP server; it has to be run by root, it "
#| "should be started during the boot process and only one LISa server can "
#| "run on one machine.</qt>"
msgid ""
"<qt><p>This wizard will ask you a few questions about your network.</p> "
"<p>Usually you can simply keep the suggested settings.</p> <p>After you have "
"finished the wizard, you will be able to browse and use shared resources on "
"your LAN, not only Samba/Windows shares, but also FTP, HTTP and NFS "
"resources exactly the same way.</p> <p>Therefore you need to setup the "
"<i>LAN Information Server</i> (LISa) on your machine. Think of the LISa "
"server as an FTP or HTTP server; it has to be run by root, it should be "
"started during the boot process and only one LISa server can run on one "
"machine.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>यो विजार्डले तपाईँको सञ्जालको बारेमा केही प्रश्नहरू सोध्नेछ ।</p> <p>प्रायजसो "
"तपाईँ सामन्य रूपमा सुझाव दिएको सेटिङ राख्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p> <p>तपाईँले विजार्ड समाप्त "
"गरेपछि, तपाईँ ब्राउज गर्न सक्नुहुनेछ र तपाईँको LAN मा साझेदार गरिएको संसाधान प्रयोग गर्न "
"सक्नुहुन्छ, साम्बा/विन्डोज साझेदार मात्र होइन, एउटै तरिकाले FTP, HTTP र NFS संसाधान पनि "
"प्रयोग गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p> <p>त्यसैले तपाईँले तपाईँको मेशिनमा<i>LAN सूचना सर्भर</i> "
"(LISa) सेटअप गर्न आवश्यक छ । लिजा सर्भरलाई एउटा एफ टी पी वा एचटीटीपी सर्भर सोचेर; "
"यसलाई मूलद्वारा चलाउनुपर्छ, यो बुट प्रक्रिया हुँदा सुरु हुनेछ र एउटा मात्रै लिजा सर्भर एउटा "
"मेशिनमा चलाउन सकिनेछ ।</qt>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:151
msgid ""
"<qt><p>More than one network interface card was found on your system.</"
"p><p>Please choose the one to which your LAN is connected.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>बढीमा एउटा सञ्जाल इन्टरफेस कार्ड तपाईँको प्रणालीमा फेला परेको थियो ।</"
"p><p>कृपया तपाईँको LAN जडान भएको एउटा रोज्नुहोस् ।</p></qt>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<qt><p><b>No network interface card was found on your system.</b></"
"p><p>Possible reason: no network card is installed. You probably want to "
"cancel now or enter your IP address and network manually</p>Example: "
"<code>192.168.0.1/255.255.255.0</code>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p><b>तपाईँको प्रणालीमा कुनै सञ्जाल इन्टरफेस कार्ड फेला परेन ।</b></p><p>सम्भाव्य "
"कारण: कुनै सञ्जाल कार्ड स्थापना गरिएको छैन । तपाईँ सम्भवत अहिले रद्द गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ वा "
"म्यानुअल तरिकाले तपाईँको आईपी ठेगाना वा सञ्जाल प्रविष्ट गर्नुहोस्</p>उदाहरणका लागि: "
"<code>192.168.0.1/255.255.255.0</code>.</qt>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:190
